# Private libraries

No project-specific libraries are currently stored here. Dependencies are
declared in `../platformio.ini`: pinned M5Unified/M5GFX commits, LVGL 9.3.0,
Adafruit MLX90614, and Adafruit BusIO. PlatformIO resolves them under `.pio`.

The application is in `../src/main.cpp`; the shared lift controller is in
`../include/lift_control.h`. Future private libraries belong in separate
subdirectories here. See `../README.md` for build and configuration instructions.
